{"4098070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHALTER-03", "steam_appid": 4098070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4833380], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHALTER-03</strong> is a first-person co-op puzzle game where each chapter and characters introduces its own unique mechanics. Taking control of three characters who lack the senses of sight, hearing, and speech, players must work together to overcome these limitations and find the correct solution, all while racing against time to solve each puzzle as efficiently as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Puzzles, Different Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level comes with its own mechanics and rules. Solutions from previous puzzles may not apply to the next. The game is designed to push players to <strong>adapt quickly</strong> and rethink their approach in every scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras/b23b8a04bca22cfe5911d5f0ccf7351a.avif?t=1788034841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras_big/b23b8a04bca22cfe5911d5f0ccf7351a.webp?t=1788034841 width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buff and Nerf Systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use various <strong>temporary buffs and nerfs</strong> that directly affect how puzzles and the environment behave. Using the right effect at the right moment can make a critical difference when racing against the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras/3d9e3afec94104bebac0d4f054861766.avif?t=1788034841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras_big/3d9e3afec94104bebac0d4f054861766.webp?t=1788034841 width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-Person Perspective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first-person camera creates a direct connection with the environment. Perspective, distance, and timing are essential for both solving puzzles and managing time efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras/d607b3f10f88980aca02453889973eb8.poster.avif?t=1788034841\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras/d607b3f10f88980aca02453889973eb8.webm?t=1788034841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098070/extras/d607b3f10f88980aca02453889973eb8.mp4?t=1788034841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Against Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a time limit. Fast thinking, precise decisions, and effective use of mechanics are key. Mistakes cost time, while mastery leads to better performance.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHALTER-03</strong> is a first-person co-op puzzle game where each chapter and characters introduces its own unique mechanics. Taking control of three characters who lack the senses of sight, hearing, and speech, players must work together to overcome these limitations and find the correct solution, all while racing against time to solve each puzzle as efficiently as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Puzzles, Different Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level comes with its own mechanics and rules. Solutions from previous puzzles may not apply to the next. The game is designed to push players to <strong>adapt quickly</strong> and rethink their approach in every scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><